## The Profit Agent

The Profit Agent is the core of Lifetimely. It is an AI agent, not a chatbot bolted onto a dashboard, and it operates in a continuous loop: monitor, analyse, plan, execute.

It monitors everything. The agent watches the store and all connected data sources 24/7 — orders, ad platforms, email, subscriptions, shipping costs — and flags what needs the merchant's attention rather than waiting to be asked.

It thinks and plans. When it spots something worth acting on — a profit opportunity, a margin risk, a customer segment worth targeting — it drafts the change and notifies the merchant for approval, with the full reasoning attached. Examples of what it proposes and executes: setting up a new bundle that lifts AOV on first orders, creating a winback campaign for lapsed VIP customers, or surfacing how a cohort is behaving before it hits the P&L.

It acts on approval. The merchant approves; the agent gets it done, within the limits they've set and with full transparency. It then measures the lift against a control, learns from the result, and iterates.

What makes it different from a general AI assistant is the data underneath. The Profit Agent is built on $100B+ in GMV across 45,000+ stores, so it already knows what good looks like for a specific business type — the benchmarks, opportunity patterns, and warning signs for a consumable brand at $12M in revenue versus an apparel brand rotating 400 SKUs per season. It applies that collective intelligence to the individual store's actual data: its purchase sequences, its cohort LTV, its COGS.

Merchants describe it as having their own data analyst. Real examples from customers: the Head of eCommerce at Bunjie reports the agent surfaced a large variance between Google and Klaviyo performance, the team shifted focus to email, pushed a campaign the same day, and saw a 15% sales uplift in three hours. The founder of Zipster asked which second-time buyers were likely shopping for a gift; the agent pulled the cohort, built the Klaviyo segment, and drafted the flow in one go.

