## Pricing

Lifetimely pricing scales with monthly order volume. There is a genuinely free plan, and every paid plan includes all features — no per-feature upsells.

- Free: up to 50 orders/month, $0. Includes daily P&L, customer behavior analytics, custom reports and dashboards, predictive LTV, benchmarks, product performance insights, and sales forecasting. No credit card required.
- S: up to 500 orders/month, $49/month.
- M: up to 3,000 orders/month, $149/month.
- L: up to 7,000 orders/month, $299/month.
- XL: up to 15,000 orders/month, $499/month, with a dedicated account manager.
- XXL: up to 25,000 orders/month, $749/month, adding Platinum support.
- Unlimited: 25,000+ orders/month, $999/month, with personalized setup and white-glove onboarding (book a demo; no self-service trial on this tier).

Every paid plan (S through XXL) starts with a 14-day free trial. All paid plans include the Profit Agent (with 5,000 credits per month), the Lifetimely MCP (Model Context Protocol integration for AI-agent workflows), unlimited integrations, unlimited users, and 24/7 support. The Profit Agent is included on paid plans only. Optional add-ons: Profit Agent Credits (+$49/month for 20,000 extra credits per month) and Amazon (+$75/month, adds Amazon sales data and reports alongside Shopify).

